1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:02,300
Day 3 in
Leoville!

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,400
31 comments yesterday…

3
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:07,200
…and 11 of them are from Mats,
who just typed "The"!

4
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:09,400
Still, that's
€22 for the town!

5
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:11,500
Yesterday: 66 residents.

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,700
Today, we are 89!

7
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,800
That brings
€23,079 into the budget!

8
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,900
MegaYanti gets
a house!

9
00:00:19,200 --> 00:00:21,200
Thomas gets
a bungalow!

10
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:23,500
Niky gets
a mansion!

11
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,000
Mats asked for
a robot as a house…

12
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,600
Beep boop, welcome home!

13
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,200
Bread asked for
a nuclear bunker…

14
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,800
Built to last!

15
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:34,800
UserFromRO, Salih and cnaaitsirh:
your homes come next!

16
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,600
TJ moves in
with Joe!

17
00:00:37,600 --> 00:00:39,800
By the way, TJ
is a rat!

18
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:42,800
UserFromRO, Salih and 15 more
move into the apartment block!

19
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,400
Not14redmi wished for
a water pump…

20
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,300
No more buckets for Leo!

21
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,700
Principal Banana makes promises!

22
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:52,100
Install water fountains!

23
00:00:52,100 --> 00:00:54,500
…and give free food every day (bananas)!

24
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,500
illegal football player and Alex
want to be president too!

25
00:00:57,500 --> 00:00:59,700
The election has
4 candidates now!

26
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:02,300
No votes yet:
reply with a name to vote!

27
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:04,700
And what do you
want next?

28
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:07,100
The school is in the lead!

29
00:01:07,200 --> 00:01:09,600
The school costs
€120,000.

30
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:11,800
Today we spent a lot
on your homes…

31
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:14,200
Keep subscribing,
and we can build it!

32
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:16,700
Who should lead
Leoville?

33
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,100
Vote in the
comments!
